**核心 API 速查（针对您重点关注的 profile 与运行时 shape 设置）：**

| 用途 | C++ | Python |
|---|---|---|
| 构建时声明动态维度 | `addInput(..., Dims3(3,-1,-1))` | `add_input(..., (3,-1,-1))` |
| 创建 profile | `builder.createOptimizationProfile()` | `builder.create_optimization_profile()` |
| 设置 MIN/OPT/MAX | `profile->setDimensions("foo", OptProfileSelector::kMIN/kOPT/kMAX, Dims3(...))` | `profile.set_shape("foo", min, opt, max)` |
| 添加 profile 到配置 | `config->addOptimizationProfile(profile)` | `config.add_optimization_profile(profile)` |
| 运行时选择 profile | `context.setOptimizationProfileAsync(0, stream)` | `context.set_optimization_profile_async(0, stream)` |
| 运行时设置输入 shape | `context.setInputShape("foo", Dims{3,{3,150,250}})` | `context.set_input_shape("foo", (3,150,250))` |
| 查询实际 shape | `context.getTensorShape("foo")` | `context.get_tensor_shape(0)` |
